  "title": "Survival Diary",
  "description": "Ghastly, red-eyed Lynn is a zombie… but unlike the others she still has the capacity to think and feel. Lynn is living alone among her fellow zombies when she meets Rawon, a man in search of his family. The two band together to set out on what may be the most treacherous adventure of their lives. \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Action, Adventure, Female Protagonist, Gore, Human-Nonhuman Friendship, Mystery, Post-Apocalyptic, Psychological, Searching For Family Member, Seinen, Supernatural, Tragedy, Travelling Female and Male Pair, Unique Infected Protagonist, Amnesia, Body Horror, Cannibalism, Female Lead, Full Color, Horror, Longstrip, Manhwa, Partially Colored, Thriller, Web Comic, Zombie Protagonist, Zombies",
